Vibezzz
=======

Vibezzz extends ai4anim-webgpu. Additional material:

`public/assets/human.glb`, `public/textures/human/*` — derived by
`tools/build-human.mjs` from the human model and skin textures of the
vibe-human project (https://github.com/xxxpawnstarxxx/vibe-human),
re-skinned onto the Geno skeleton. `src/render/skin.ts` adapts
vibe-human's TSL skin / eye materials.

`public/assets/env/potsdamer_platz_1k.hdr` — "Potsdamer Platz" HDRI from
Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com/a/potsdamer_platz), CC0.

`src/runtime/driven_joints.ts` — twist extraction follows the approach of
RigLogic's twist/swing joint evaluator in OpenRigLogic
(https://github.com/EpicGames/OpenRigLogic), Copyright (c) 2026 Epic
Games, Inc., MIT License.

Gamepad teleop (inspired by the joystick velocity-command teleop in
NVIDIA GR00T-WholeBodyControl, Apache-2.0) and tap-to-select (inspired
by Human Atlas, MIT) are original implementations; no code was copied.
